# Red Guardian, Super-Soldier: Flash, and "When Red Guardian enters, destroy target creature an opponent controls that dealt damage
# this turn." On turn 4 both of Bot2's Ageless Guardians (1/4) attack; Bot1's Ageless Guardian blocks one, so both deal 1 damage (one
# to Bot1, one to the blocker), and nothing dies. Bot2 also has an Ornithopter that dealt none. Red Guardian, flashed in after combat
# damage, can't choose Bot1's own Guardian (it dealt damage, but "an opponent controls") or the Ornithopter (an opponent's, but it
# dealt none) - the refusals at the choice between the two Guardians - and destroys the unblocked one.

